{"id":"7ad117274f74965a","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-omega.md","title":"Natural Numbers and Least Inductive Set","display":"df-omega — Natural Numbers and Least Inductive Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-omega","aliases":["89-df-omega"],"display":"df-omega — Natural Numbers and Least Inductive Set","depends_on":[],"created":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-omega"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-omega</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega — Natural Numbers and Least Inductive Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在 ZFC 元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为由无穷公理给出的任一归纳集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span> 为空集。</li>\n<li>下述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ind}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ind}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_\\omega\">\\(S_\\omega\\)</span> 为元语言集合和函数，不是算术对象语言符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nS_\\omega(x)&amp;\\coloneqq x\\cup\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ind}(X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\in X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\ S_\\omega(x)\\in X,\\\\\n\\omega&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq I\\mid\\operatorname{Ind}(X)\\},\\qquad\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega,\\\\\n0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad n+1\\coloneqq S_\\omega(n),\\quad\nm&lt;n\\Longleftrightarrow m\\in n,\\quad m\\le n\\Longleftrightarrow m&lt;n\\lor m=n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nS_\\omega(x)&amp;\\coloneqq x\\cup\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ind}(X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\in X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\ S_\\omega(x)\\in X,\\\\\n\\omega&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq I\\mid\\operatorname{Ind}(X)\\},\\qquad\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega,\\\\\n0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad n+1\\coloneqq S_\\omega(n),\\quad\nm&lt;n\\Longleftrightarrow m\\in n,\\quad m\\le n\\Longleftrightarrow m&lt;n\\lor m=n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条补齐本书实际使用但原压缩包未提供的基础接口；不恢复或冒充其他书籍的原文件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"S_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nS_\\omega(x)&\\coloneqq x\\cup\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ind}(X)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\in X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\ S_\\omega(x)\\in X,\\\\\n\\omega&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq I\\mid\\operatorname{Ind}(X)\\},\\qquad\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega,\\\\\n0&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad n+1\\coloneqq S_\\omega(n),\\quad\nm<n\\Longleftrightarrow m\\in n,\\quad m\\le n\\Longleftrightarrow m<n\\lor m=n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1105,"backlinks":[{"id":"3997bfb78544d69c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2